flowchart LR
    UI[Question and filters] --> HOOK[n8n Webhook]
    HOOK --> INTERPRET[Local Qwen: interpret natural language]
    INTERPRET --> PLAN[Validate allowlisted query plan]
    PLAN --> RAW[Mock Qualtrics: full snapshot]
    RAW --> METRICS[Deterministic TypeScript analytics]
    GOLD[Independent Python golden reference] --> VERIFY[Check every field and checksum]
    METRICS --> VERIFY
    VERIFY --> RAG[Keyword retrieval with Qwen query rewriting]
    KB[Four approved Markdown documents] --> RAG
    RAG --> QWEN[Local Qwen: select fact and passage IDs]
    QWEN --> GATE[Validate IDs and render approved evidence]
    GATE --> RECEIPT[n8n execution and actual model receipts]
    RECEIPT --> UI
    VERIFY -->|FAIL or unavailable| BLOCK[Withhold numerical answer]
    INTERPRET -->|unsupported or unavailable| ERROR[Visible error]
    QWEN -->|invalid or unavailable| ERROR
